          "action": "Compute RSS shares",
          "details": "$[[v^*]]^A \\leftarrow \text{RSS.sMul}((-1)^\\sigma, [v]]^A)$; $[[b]]^A \\leftarrow \text{RSS.add}([v^*]]^A, [[\\beta]]^A$",
